 "wikitext": "[[File:SuijidexIcon.png|thumb]]\nThe '''Sujidex''' ({{JP|スジモン図鑑}}, ''Sujimon Zukan'', Lit. \"Sujimon Encyclopedia\") is a telephone application featured in both ''[[Yakuza: Like a Dragon]]'' and ''[[Like a Dragon: Infinite Wealth]]''. It is the franchise's equivalent of an enemy list or {{WP|Bestiary|bestiary}}, as it keeps track of all the '''[[Sujimon]]''' that the player encounters.\n\n==List of Sujimon ([[Yakuza: Like a Dragon|Y:LAD]])==\n{| class=\"wikitable sortable\"\n|-\n! class=\"unsortable\" |Icon!!Number !!Name \n|-\n|[[File:Burnout Bully Icon.png|75px]]||1||[[Burnout Bully]]\n|-\n|[[File:Capitalist Punisher Icon.png|75px]]||2||[[Capitalist Punisher]]\n|-\n|[[File:Dotcombatant Icon.png|75px]]||3||[[Dotcombatant]]\n|}\n\n==List of Sujimon ([[Like a Dragon: Infinite Wealth|LaD:IW]])==\n{| class=\"wikitable sortable\"\n|-\n! class=\"unsortable\" |Icon!!Number!!Name\n|-\n|[[File:Burnout Bully Icon.png|75px]]||1||[[Burnout Bully]]\n|-\n|[[File:Capitalist Punisher Icon.png|75px]]||2||[[Capitalist Punisher]]\n|-\n|[[File:Hammeredhead Icon.png|75px]]||3||[[Hammeredhead]]\n|-\n|[[File:Knight of the Cask Icon.png|75px]]||4||[[Knight of the Cask]]\n|-\n|[[File:Urbane Legend Icon.png|75px]]||5||[[Urbane Legend]]\n|-\n|[[File:Battle Bum Icon.png|75px]]||6||[[Battle Bum]]\n|-\n| [[File:Hungry_Hungry_Homeless Icon.png|75px]]||7||[[Hungry Hungry Homeless]]\n|-\n|[[File:Invested Vagabond Icon.png|75px]]|| 8|| [[Invested Vagabond]]\n|-\n| ||9||[[Transcendent Transient]] \n|-\n|[[File:Biting Barker Icon.png|75px]]||10 ||[[Biting Barker]]\n|-\n| [[File:Punkling Icon.png|75px]]||13||[[Punkling|Street Punk]]\n|-\n|[[File:The Fist Icon.png|75px]]||22||[[The Fist|Fundoshin]]\n|-\n|[[File:Demolitioneer Icon.png|75px]]||25||[[Demolitioneer]]\n|-\n|[[File:King of Thieves Icon.png|75px]]||30||[[King of Thieves]]\n|-\n|[[File:Weltraiser Icon.png|75px]]||40||[[Weltraiser]]\n|-\n|[[File:King Joe Icon.png|75px]]||60||[[King Joe]]\n|-\n|[[File:Peacemaker Icon.png|75px]]||90